@context: Beyond CLICK — HOVER, DOUBLE CLICK, RIGHT CLICK, DRAG, PRESS, and browser dialogs.
@title: mouse_and_keyboard

@var: {site} = http://localhost:8000

STEP 1: Mouse
    NAVIGATE to {site}/mouse.html
    HOVER over the 'Avatar'
    VERIFY that 'Signed in as Manul' is present
    DOUBLE CLICK the 'Copy link' button
    VERIFY that 'Link copied' is present
    RIGHT CLICK the 'File area'
    CLICK the 'Rename' button
    VERIFY that 'Renamed' is present

STEP 2: Drag and drop
    DRAG 'Write tests' and drop it into 'Done'
    VERIFY that 'Write tests moved to Done' is present

STEP 3: Keyboard
    FILL 'Search' field with 'manul'
    PRESS Enter
    VERIFY that 'Results for manul' is present
    CLICK the 'Open dialog' button
    VERIFY that 'Dialog is open' is present
    PRESS Escape
    VERIFY that 'Dialog is open' is NOT present

STEP 4: alert / confirm are answered with OK
    CLICK the 'Delete account' button
    VERIFY that 'Account deleted' is present

DONE.
